  "id": "mcs",
  "term": "MCS",
  "definition": "MCS refers to Military Soul Care, a Swedish military chaplaincy model that supports service members’ existential, moral, and human needs as part of a broader biopsychosocial-spiritual view of mental health. In this context, it is described as an inclusive, culturally embedded approach that helps preserve humanity, support ethical reflection, and assist meaning-making in military settings.",
